{"schemaVersion":2,"book":"SNG","chapter":2,"sourceModule":"original-languages-step","targetBible":"bsb","proposalMethod":"exact STEPBible English gloss match against fixed BSB text","targetTexts":{"1":"I am a rose of Sharon, a lily of the valley.","2":"Like a lily among the thorns is my darling among the maidens.","3":"Like an apple tree among the trees of the forest is my beloved among the young men. I delight to sit in his shade, and his fruit is sweet to my taste.","4":"He has brought me to the house of wine, and his banner over me is love.","5":"Sustain me with raisins; refresh me with apples, for I am faint with love.","6":"His left hand is under my head, and his right arm embraces me.","7":"O daughters of Jerusalem, I adjure you by the gazelles and does of the field: Do not arouse or awaken love until the time is right.","8":"Listen! My beloved approaches. Look! Here he comes, leaping across the mountains, bounding over the hills.","9":"My beloved is like a gazelle or a young stag. Look, he stands behind our wall, gazing through the windows, peering through the lattice.","10":"My beloved calls to me, “Arise, my darling. Come away with me, my beautiful one.","11":"For now the winter is past; the rain is over and gone.","12":"The flowers have appeared in the countryside; the season of singing has come, and the cooing of turtledoves is heard in our land.","13":"The fig tree ripens its figs; the blossoming vines spread their fragrance. Arise, come away, my darling; come away with me, my beautiful one.”","14":"O my dove in the clefts of the rock, in the crevices of the cliff, let me see your face, let me hear your voice; for your voice is sweet, and your countenance is lovely.","15":"Catch for us the foxes—the little foxes that ruin the vineyards—for our vineyards are in bloom.","16":"My beloved is mine and I am his; he pastures his flock among the lilies.","17":"Before the day breaks and shadows flee, turn, my beloved, and be like a gazelle or a young stag on the mountains of Bether."},"targetSegments":{"1":[{"id":"SNG.2.1.s1","position":1,"text":"I","normalized":"i"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s2","position":2,"text":"am","normalized":"am"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s3","position":3,"text":"a","normalized":"a"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s4","position":4,"text":"rose","normalized":"rose"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s5","position":5,"text":"of","normalized":"of"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s6","position":6,"text":"Sharon","normalized":"sharon"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s7","position":7,"text":"a","normalized":"a"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s8","position":8,"text":"lily","normalized":"lily"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s9","position":9,"text":"of","normalized":"of"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s10","position":10,"text":"the","normalized":"the"},{"id":"SNG.2.1.s11","position":11,"text":"valley","normalized":"valley"}],"2":[{"id":"SNG.2.2.s1","position":1,"text":"Like","normalized":"like"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s2","position":2,"text":"a","normalized":"a"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s3","position":3,"text":"lily","normalized":"lily"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s4","position":4,"text":"among","normalized":"among"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s5","position":5,"text":"the","normalized":"the"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s6","position":6,"text":"thorns","normalized":"thorns"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s7","position":7,"text":"is","normalized":"is"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s8","position":8,"text":"my","normalized":"my"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s9","position":9,"text":"darling","normalized":"darling"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s10","position":10,"text":"among","normalized":"among"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s11","position":11,"text":"the","normalized":"the"},{"id":"SNG.2.2.s12","position":12,"text":"maidens","normalized":"maidens"}],"3":[{"id":"SNG.2.3.s1","position":1,"text":"Like","normalized":"like"},{"id":"SNG.2.3.s2","position":2,"text":"an","normalized":"an"},{"id":"SNG.2.3.s3","position":3,"text":"apple","normalized":"apple"},{"id":"SNG.2.3.s4","position":4,"text":"tree","normalized":"tree"},{"id":"SNG.2.3.s5","position":5,"text":"among","normalized":"among"},{"id":"SNG.2.3.s6","position":6,"text":"the","normalized":"the"},{"id":"SNG.2